4692470868_5425549575320582278_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=usDA0plaG8oQ7kNvwH0dxSo&_nc_oc=Adm_HBsbCNpxV9FWyZMpQwG-JwPaeUUeJN_4YRYHZDMbDwXWcdaeKV94dEkiLgbAzRI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsfsUifQ052XyBn1VfZWJTM167wFmPrp6hxyU21_uJHcg&oe=69A59C6C"}, {"file_name": "Symphoni-Screenshot-05.png", "id": "1349648676476742", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391862_1349648679810075_447301309409170078_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=36RbLr5mShQQ7kNvwGlg0Hm&_nc_oc=AdkWsibWFdMnjYz7NY7_8zCfd_DECLL6X2alr9lUWDNDJS5ju44z2YjF0ZIpTLO_fog&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvi0lOCbraRRBNc9TwTdhaT4nN8VCDmD5SdLzeI8aggpA&oe=69A58771"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "PUB_Symphoni_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "9364163683649872", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393723_9364163690316538_1881822928577390435_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ihDFRRDCds0Q7kNvwF0W6Mt&_nc_oc=Adlk39GFHQ_9mElnQKAukG5Q4ZRpwyysA3vP6zvRdxy67wfw50DERnzDWOIVPQ9fE3Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftzo7a8ogJQn6lB_8RBBmNAMrMnXUSi2_OcG-7PwBmxaw&oe=69A5746B"}, "display_name": "Symphoni", "keywords": ["Conducting", "Maestro", "Wizard", "Magic", "Rhythm"], "long_description": "# Wave Your Wand. Command the Music. Become the Wizard of Symphonies.\nWelcome to **Symphoni**, where you can be a grand musical wizard who breathes new life into classical music. Unlike traditional rhythm games, **Symphoni** lets you conduct, cast spells, and transform reality while grooving to the classics.\n{1043215534309263}{664540836007804}\n\n\n# \ud83c\udfbc Wield the Power of Music\nConduct the symphony with your wand and cast spellbinding portals to the rhythm of classical masterpieces.\n{633925752354407}\n\n# \ud83c\udf0e Step Into Magical Realms\nExperience visually stunning MR transitions as your living room transforms into enchanted symphonic worlds.\n{1017135330244800}\n# \ud83c\udfb5 16 Timeless Masterpieces\nChallenge yourself with Tchaikovsky, Beethoven, and more across three difficulty levels and four magical realms.\n{921407033308625}\n# \ud83d\udd2e Collect Wands & Unlock Crystals\nLevel up your magical abilities, unlock 25 unique achievement crystals, and collect four legendary wands.\n{2753157158218964}{602916329194974}\n# \ud83e\ude84 Master the Magic of Motion\nPlay using **hand-tracking** for an immersive conducting experience, or use **controllers** for precise rhythmic gameplay.\n{1132195501699773}\n# \ud83d\udcdd Symphoni Creator (Coming Soon)\nCompose your own musical challenges and try out **user-generated Symphonies**.\n{971665371137427}\n#  \u2728 Experience the Magic of Music\nWith **16 masterpieces, 3 difficulties, wand collections, collectible crystals, and a custom song editor + free song updates** planned in the near future, get ready to raise your wand and experience the magic of classical music like never before.\n", "short_description": "Welcome to Symphoni, where you can be a grand musical wizard who breathes new life into classical music. Unlike traditional rhythm games, Symphoni lets you conduct, cast spells, and transform reality while grooving tothe classics.\n\nWith 16 masterpieces, 3 difficulties, wand collections, collectible crystals, and a custom song editor + free song updates planned in the near future, get ready to raise your wand and experience the magic of classical music like never before."}]}, "developer_name": "techToy Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://techtoy.studio/symphoni-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "techToy Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://symphoni.games/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "16725773968719